= Beary

Beary is a strange anthropormophic bear who claims he is a <span style="color: #c00000;">socialist</span> from the distant future. The party is very confused about this development but we cannot deny Beary can do a lot for us.

- @modern_propaganda
- @hindsight
- @crisis
- @money
- @radicalize_new_middle
- @root: Return to main

@modern_propaganda
title: Phonk edits and Furry art
subtitle: Increase the popularity of <span style="color: #c00000;">socialism</span> through...modern...methods
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?] 
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 1; new_middle_spd += 8*(1-dissent); worker_spd += 8*(1-dissent); unemployed_spd += 8*(1-dissent); old_middle_spd += 6*(1-dissent); socialism += 6;

Through somewhat unconventional methods we have spread futuristic propaganda among the masses. We may not fully understand it but we cannot deny it's effectiveness.

@hindsight
title: Speak of the Future
subtitle: Warn the party of the upcoming crisis
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 1; labor_dissent -= 10; centrist_dissent -= 10; reformist_dissent -= 10; left_dissent -= 10; nazi_urgency += 5;

Beary has told us of the upcoming depression and the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Nazi</span> menace, the party must stand united and prepare.

@crisis
title: Addressing the economic crisis!
subtitle: Hindsight is 20/20
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0 and nationalization_adopted == 0 and black_thursday_seen == 1
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if black_thursday_seen == 0 : We are not currently in an economic crisis. ?][? if nationalization_adopted > 0 : We have already adopted the Left plan. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 1; 

@money
title: Print Money
subtitle: Provide disscretionary funds for the government budget
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0 and moderate_plan_adopted = 0 and black_thursday_seen = 1
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?] [? if spd_in_government == 0 : The <span style="color: #c00000;">SPD</span> is not currently in government. ?] 
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 1; budget += 2;

